'''Log''' (丸太, ''Maruta'', '''Log''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Log
|image = E 695.png
|appearance = [[Summer Break Cats Castaway#Jungle Survival|Jungle Survival]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
Log is practically just a copy of [[Firecracker]] with no trait, slightly better stats and a longer slow.

==Strategy==
Most strategies used against Firecracker will work against this enemy.

